### Update expense
# Replace EXPENSE_ID with a real MongoDB ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/expenses/EXPENSE_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Supermarket Updated",
  "amount": 150.75,
  "category": "Food",
  "date": "2026-10-05",
  "paymentMethod": "Credit Card",
  "isRecurring": false,
  "notes": "Updated grocery expense"
}


### Delete expense
# Replace EXPENSE_ID with a real MongoDB ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/expenses/EXPENSE_ID


### Confirm expense was deleted
GET {{baseUrl}}/expenses/EXPENSE_ID


